=== THM-217 ↔ Metallic Mean Connection ===

3×3 transfer matrix char poly: λ³ - λ² - xλ - x = 0
Want to factor as (λ - α)(λ² - (n-2)λ - n) = 0

n=3: x(const)=0, x(coeff)=3, match=False
n=4: x(const)=4, x(coeff)=6, match=False
