UNIQUE match at n=6 with x=18.
At n=6, x=18: λ³ - λ² - 18λ - 18 = (λ+3)(λ² - 4λ - 6)
Metallic eigenvalue: (4+√40)/2 = 2+√10 ≈ 5.16227766016838

Roots of λ³-λ²-18λ-18: [ 5.162278 -1.162278 -3.      ]
x_6 = (4+√40)/2 = 5.162278
-3 is a root: 0

=== Physical meaning of x=n(n-3) in THM-217 ===
THM-217 parameter x: weight for matched pairs in HP counting
g_k(m) counts k-matchings of path P_{m+2k-1} weighted by 2^{c(M)}
At x=n(n-3): the 'matching parameter' equals n(n-3)

n=3: x=n(n-3)=0, C(n-1,2)=1, C(n,2)-n=0
